e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QovK3wql4hcQ7kNvwFpp-xw&_nc_oc=Adquo_uBFi-rde4BTU7aSSJiAjkLP7EO-rWnVudAfNiCN1uaYAMmuBvrHHtGGKPw9kA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEwkHjUzRgYX0X2PRpfyLgzvzXoKIpqeXeFnD9hyjc4KQ&oe=6A7B3AF9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l3nESBe8ZRYQ7kNvwHQnLuQ&_nc_oc=AdqJP5DK8UUiweC_qdKbK8LEaYjacslbD0RGqPJMFbPtHjVOUqRKszvzqG2bucAFE3c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEKsVUo4NmlZkJcnqK6TnnK_5ZdE5el7DNv7MiYV4aOKg&oe=6A7B1253"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8XMKaCOR5pQQ7kNvwFjmFRo&_nc_oc=Adp-nl6e0IFsn5K9BDW1Q5IpUknp-m1OJOilXl2F-uyQNGWj-GJteaddAEylLCtsNuQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEfCHvcN403OC_w0yBMaMFplKvNId1-Sp2Rd7kUw3V94w&oe=6A7B1DFB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MZOFAT_yLEAQ7kNvwGiEuDt&_nc_oc=AdruEG-Y8Mhg0ToQYe0nxogJXSOeVCYfHBE2-bsIfpbg9SAYGWDIf5vN2PyM_rWi7Ug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGIiw9ITty6Gb0qhalD2-AZmtPIUE7PUsDb2Y2jc3sMZg&oe=6A7B1F4A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lpEMhjmnq9kQ7kNvwF6FKFk&_nc_oc=AdoXwnPknmYgszQdbFHCjmGpHlgfodOXpFXWDGMOT2-VaE7EwJw3UALSCPSG43F8X2g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGcKgQiEobqqQcyhwg0Pnaup0IuIVMxUHm8D19qa7plXQ&oe=6A7B087E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se